WEBVTT

00:25.901 --> 00:28.737
[water dripping]

00:43.752 --> 00:45.128
[brakes squeak]

00:45.212 --> 00:46.380
[car engine shuts off]

00:47.089 --> 00:48.090
Hey.

00:49.174 --> 00:50.217
Heeju.

00:55.389 --> 00:56.640
[seat belt unbuckles]

01:17.411 --> 01:19.413
[metal sign clanging]

01:43.353 --> 01:46.023
[gold clanging]

01:51.695 --> 01:52.946
[gold bars clinking]

01:54.156 --> 01:55.282
[grunts]

01:57.784 --> 01:58.869
[Woogy grunts]

02:04.124 --> 02:05.417
[gold bar clangs]

02:12.341 --> 02:13.383
[grunts]

02:19.222 --> 02:20.223
[clinks]

02:20.307 --> 02:21.350
Huh?

02:23.769 --> 02:25.646
[Woogy] What the hell?

02:26.647 --> 02:29.650
[♪ dramatic music]

02:32.736 --> 02:34.154
[clinking]

02:34.237 --> 02:35.864
[grunts]

02:40.160 --> 02:41.411
Shit.

02:42.245 --> 02:43.246
[grunts]

02:45.248 --> 02:47.000
[groaning]

02:48.210 --> 02:49.878
[Heeju] That's enough.
[gun cocks]

02:51.421 --> 02:52.839
Just put the gold in the car.

02:52.923 --> 02:56.134
Hey, you're messing with me.

02:56.218 --> 02:57.594
[Woogy] It's not loaded, right?

02:58.679 --> 02:59.680
[Heeju shouts]

03:02.599 --> 03:05.602
[Heeju breathing heavily]

03:09.064 --> 03:10.357
Shut up and don't say anything!

03:12.317 --> 03:15.070
The gold.
Put it in the back of the car.

03:18.281 --> 03:20.325
Okay. I'll do it.

03:21.284 --> 03:24.287
[car engine revving]

03:31.503 --> 03:34.506
[cell phone vibrating]

03:36.925 --> 03:38.760
CHAIRMAN AHN GYUSEOK
INCOMING CALL

03:41.930 --> 03:42.973
Yes, Chairman.

03:43.390 --> 03:44.558
[Gyuseok] Did you find the casket?

03:46.601 --> 03:48.937
Not yet.
I'm close, though, sir.

03:51.440 --> 03:54.067
[Gyuseok] Didn't you say you found out who
the accomplice was?

03:54.151 --> 03:55.444
Lee Dokyung's girl.

03:56.987 --> 03:58.071
[Hocheol] Yes, that's right.

03:58.155 --> 04:00.407
I'm actually after her right now, sir.
Don't worry.

04:01.324 --> 04:02.451
I'm on it.

04:02.534 --> 04:04.911
-I'll make sure to find the gold no-
-[Gyuseok] Gold?

04:09.207 --> 04:10.292
[phone chimes and disconnects]

04:15.922 --> 04:17.966
Fuck me.

04:24.723 --> 04:26.641
-Chief Cheon.
-[Woojin] Yes, sir.

04:27.976 --> 04:29.895
Can we wrap things up here today?

04:29.978 --> 04:31.229
Yes, sir.
We're almost done.

04:33.899 --> 04:35.525
Tie up any loose ends now.

04:37.319 --> 04:38.945
We're going to Jeongsan tomorrow.
STYLE
::cue()

04:39.821 --> 04:40.822
[Woojin] Yes, Chairman.

04:45.410 --> 04:48.413
[♪ suspenseful music]

04:48.955 --> 04:52.459
[distant sirens blaring]

04:52.542 --> 04:55.545
[♪ sad piano music]

05:18.276 --> 05:21.279
[♪ music continues]

05:35.710 --> 05:38.713
EPISODE 6
FISSURE

05:38.797 --> 05:41.716
INCLINED SHAFT 8, SECTION 0
100ML

05:43.260 --> 05:44.344
[gold bar clinks]

05:44.427 --> 05:46.805
[breathing heavily]

05:46.888 --> 05:48.265
[groans]

05:49.599 --> 05:51.560
Ah, shit.
This is fucking hard.

05:52.727 --> 05:53.895
Heeju!

05:54.688 --> 05:56.648
Ah, this is the last of it.

05:56.731 --> 05:58.066
[Woogy breathing heavily]

05:58.149 --> 05:59.609
[Woogy] If you had done this
by yourself,

05:59.693 --> 06:01.695
ah, I bet it would have taken all day.

06:01.778 --> 06:03.989
[Woogy chuckling]

06:04.072 --> 06:05.740
[groaning]

06:06.491 --> 06:07.701
Okay.

06:09.119 --> 06:11.830
Now we just need to take care
of Cha Yujin, right?

06:11.913 --> 06:13.665
-Then no one else knows.
-[exhales]

06:13.748 --> 06:15.208
You know about it now, too.

06:15.959 --> 06:18.378
[Woogy] Come on. It's me.

06:19.087 --> 06:20.338
Heeju.

06:20.422 --> 06:21.631
I just want my share.
That's all.

06:23.258 --> 06:28.430
Okay, so now we just make potatoes
and sell them just like before.

06:29.472 --> 06:31.850
Sound good?
I'll still sell them.

06:36.354 --> 06:38.106
[stammers]

06:40.150 --> 06:41.151
Okay.

06:43.904 --> 06:45.322
There. You can check the gold bars.

06:47.824 --> 06:48.867
[Woogy] Hmm?

06:48.950 --> 06:49.951
Yeah?

06:50.910 --> 06:51.911
Okay?

06:52.454 --> 06:53.663
So, we good?

06:54.205 --> 06:55.790
-Don't come any closer.
-[gasps]

06:57.417 --> 06:58.418
Really?

06:59.711 --> 07:01.504
[Woogy] You said Cha Yujin is on her way.

07:01.588 --> 07:03.423
You think you can kill her by yourself?

07:03.506 --> 07:05.634
I'll kill her for you, yeah?

07:05.717 --> 07:07.260
Just like I got rid
of Han Cheoljung for you.

07:09.763 --> 07:11.097
I can do it myself.

07:11.806 --> 07:12.807
Now move.

07:15.101 --> 07:16.394
-Over there?
-Just shut up!

07:16.478 --> 07:17.646
-[Woogy] Okay, okay!
-Move out of the way.

07:24.486 --> 07:25.487
Turn around.

07:26.488 --> 07:27.489
Come on.

07:28.406 --> 07:29.449
Heeju, please don't do this.

07:29.532 --> 07:31.034
-Turn around.
-[Woogy] Heeju.

07:31.117 --> 07:32.661
L-let's talk about this, okay?

07:32.744 --> 07:34.871
You and me.
We're in this together.

07:34.954 --> 07:35.955
Yeah?

07:36.790 --> 07:38.583
Hey, I saved your life, didn't I?

07:38.667 --> 07:40.377
But what?
You still don't trust me?

07:40.794 --> 07:42.045
I can't trust anyone.

07:42.128 --> 07:43.713
[Woogy] Okay, okay, okay, okay.

07:44.172 --> 07:45.256
Okay, how about this?

07:46.216 --> 07:47.926
I didn't see anything.

07:48.677 --> 07:50.804
I never saw a single gold bar.
I wasn't here.

07:50.887 --> 07:53.390
-I told you to turn around!
-[Woogy] Okay, okay, okay, okay!

07:55.433 --> 07:56.434
Heeju, please.

07:57.102 --> 07:58.228
[Woogy] Please, just calm down.

07:59.854 --> 08:01.314
Please don't do this. Please?

08:01.940 --> 08:03.525
You know I'm always on your side, right?

08:04.359 --> 08:07.112
Even if everyone else betrays you,
I could never do that to you!

08:07.195 --> 08:08.780
Please just trust me, 'kay?

08:10.281 --> 08:11.282
Just fucking shoot me, then!

08:12.158 --> 08:13.284
[Woogy] But Kim Heeju...

08:14.369 --> 08:17.288
...if you do, I fucking swear that
you'll die right here with me, too.

08:20.667 --> 08:23.670
[♪ tense music]

08:28.883 --> 08:31.886
[crashing]

08:34.222 --> 08:37.475
[car engine revving]

08:37.559 --> 08:38.768
Dammit.

08:39.394 --> 08:40.687
[grunts]

08:40.770 --> 08:43.940
[engine revving]

08:44.733 --> 08:45.734
Fuck.

08:45.817 --> 08:47.027
[shouting]

08:48.445 --> 08:49.487
[gold bars clang]

08:49.571 --> 08:53.074
[Heeju] Take all of that cash
and the rest of the potatoes.

08:53.158 --> 08:55.076
That should be enough
to cover your share.

08:55.744 --> 08:57.871
Shouldn't it?
Now go.

08:59.956 --> 09:01.416
What about you?

09:01.499 --> 09:03.168
[Heeju] I can take care of myself.

09:03.251 --> 09:05.170
Don't come looking for me.

09:07.088 --> 09:08.923
Forget about everything you saw here.

09:09.632 --> 09:11.092
And move on with your life.

09:11.634 --> 09:14.137
If I ever see you again,
I don't know.

09:15.930 --> 09:18.141
I might actually shoot you.
STYLE
::cue()

09:19.517 --> 09:22.520
DAD! BE SAFE AGAIN TODAY

09:22.604 --> 09:25.607
[breathing heavily]

09:29.194 --> 09:32.030
INCLINED SHAFT 8, SECTION 0
100ML

09:32.113 --> 09:33.615
[exhales]

09:35.200 --> 09:38.203
[labored breathing]

09:38.703 --> 09:40.497
[gold bars clinking]

09:44.000 --> 09:46.753
-You're sure?
-Please! Come on, just go! Go!

09:47.879 --> 09:48.880
[Heeju] Shit!

09:52.342 --> 09:53.676
Call me if you need anything.

09:54.677 --> 09:55.845
[Woogy] 'Kay?

09:56.304 --> 09:57.847
I'm going. Okay?

09:58.515 --> 10:00.850
[distant clanging]
[gasps]

10:00.934 --> 10:02.227
[gasps]

10:03.478 --> 10:04.938
[drum clattering]

10:06.981 --> 10:08.066
Dammit.

10:10.401 --> 10:12.028
[Heeju breathing heavily]

10:12.612 --> 10:14.280
[Woogy] Oh, shit.
Who's that?

10:14.364 --> 10:15.907
Fuck it, who cares?
Let's get outta here!

10:15.990 --> 10:17.325
[panicked breathing]

10:17.408 --> 10:18.618
[Woogy] Who the fuck is that?

10:18.701 --> 10:20.453
[panicked breathing]

10:27.502 --> 10:30.505
[vehicle approaching]

10:31.631 --> 10:32.882
[Heeju whimpers]
What do we do?

10:32.966 --> 10:34.509
[Woogy] Dammit, who...

10:34.592 --> 10:36.052
-Is that the boss?
-Huh?

10:36.136 --> 10:37.137
Ah, fuck!

10:39.722 --> 10:43.893
[car engine revving]

10:43.977 --> 10:45.270
-[Woogy shouts]
-[Heeju screams]

10:46.146 --> 10:47.814
-Dammit, we're fucked.
-[Heeju] What do we do? What do we do?

10:48.314 --> 10:49.399
[Woogy] We're fucking fucked.

10:49.482 --> 10:50.692
[both breathing heavily]

10:50.775 --> 10:52.944
[tires squeal]

10:57.657 --> 10:59.117
Fuck!

11:01.202 --> 11:02.287
[tires screech]

11:09.210 --> 11:11.004
[both breathing heavily]

11:11.087 --> 11:12.380
[Heeju gasps]

11:12.463 --> 11:14.340
-[Heeju] Look out!
-[Woogy shouts]

11:14.424 --> 11:15.925
[tires squealing]

11:18.136 --> 11:21.139
[both groaning]

11:22.849 --> 11:23.850
Wait.

11:23.933 --> 11:25.351
[Woogy groaning]

11:34.110 --> 11:36.196
[Heeju] It's Cha Yujin's car.

11:48.958 --> 11:49.959
She's dead.

11:51.169 --> 11:52.170
[Heeju] What?

11:56.174 --> 11:57.175
[gold bars clink]

11:58.676 --> 12:00.220
[Woogy] Give me the gun.

12:00.303 --> 12:01.304
[Heeju] What?

12:02.347 --> 12:03.973
[Woogy] Park might have seen us.
We have no other choice.

12:04.057 --> 12:05.350
We gotta kill the guy.

12:08.478 --> 12:09.520
[Woogy] Just give it to me.

12:09.604 --> 12:11.314
[gold bars clinking]

12:12.857 --> 12:14.192
[Heeju] Wait!

12:16.194 --> 12:17.237
Just stay here!

12:17.779 --> 12:19.239
I'll be right back.

12:19.322 --> 12:20.740
[exhales]

12:21.741 --> 12:24.744
[water dripping]

12:56.276 --> 12:57.402
[gun clicks]

12:57.944 --> 12:58.945
[gun clicks]
[Woogy grunts]

12:59.028 --> 13:01.656
[breathing heavily]

13:04.158 --> 13:06.911
[both shouting]

13:08.079 --> 13:09.080
Shit.

13:12.959 --> 13:14.252
Fuck.

13:14.335 --> 13:17.338
[Woogy breathing heavily]

13:18.172 --> 13:19.340
[blow lands]
[both grunt]

13:20.091 --> 13:21.426
[blow lands]

13:22.218 --> 13:25.221
[both shouting]
STYLE
::cue()

13:40.528 --> 13:41.738
[Hocheol] Shit!

13:41.821 --> 13:44.991
[both grunting]

13:53.583 --> 13:56.586
[both breathing heavily]

13:58.463 --> 13:59.881
Ah, shit.

14:02.633 --> 14:03.885
[gunshot]
[gasps]

14:03.968 --> 14:05.344
[shouts]

14:05.428 --> 14:06.637
Shit.

14:07.221 --> 14:08.222
Dammit.

14:08.306 --> 14:09.474
[grunts]

14:09.557 --> 14:11.225
[groaning]

14:18.524 --> 14:21.527
[breathing heavily]

14:57.688 --> 14:59.899
[shallow panicked breathing]

15:16.124 --> 15:19.418
[shallow breathing]

15:22.421 --> 15:23.756
[rustling]

15:34.267 --> 15:36.102
[cell phone ringing]

15:37.895 --> 15:39.063
TEAM LEADER CHA YUJIN
OUTGOING CALL

15:42.567 --> 15:44.527
[ringing continues]

15:46.279 --> 15:48.698
[phone ringing]

16:00.626 --> 16:02.295
-[Heeju grunting]
-Bitch!

16:03.296 --> 16:05.298
-[Hocheol grunting]
-[Heeju screams]

16:05.381 --> 16:07.925
[both grunting]

16:10.011 --> 16:11.721
[Heeju shouting]

16:11.804 --> 16:14.724
[both grunting]

16:15.933 --> 16:18.019
[spray can hissing]

16:18.769 --> 16:20.855
[car engine revving]

16:24.775 --> 16:27.778
[shouting]

16:33.492 --> 16:36.370
YANGPO JEIL HOSPITAL

16:44.879 --> 16:46.214
Ah, there.

16:46.297 --> 16:47.590
[Dokyung groans]

16:47.673 --> 16:49.842
Okay, can you try standing?
Walking a little?

16:49.926 --> 16:51.260
-[Dokyung] Yeah.
-Careful.

16:51.344 --> 16:52.345
[Dokyung groans]

16:54.513 --> 16:58.017
You'll likely have some pain
for a while so don't overdo it.

16:58.100 --> 17:00.269
-[Doctor] All right, we're all done here.
-[Dokyung] Doctor.

17:00.353 --> 17:01.520
What?

17:01.604 --> 17:02.980
[Dokyung] I'm very sorry about this.

17:08.236 --> 17:09.237
[Doctor shouting muffled]

17:11.197 --> 17:13.032
[muffled shouting continues]

17:14.408 --> 17:16.327
[Doctor groaning]

17:18.204 --> 17:23.334
[shouting]

17:23.417 --> 17:25.544
-[Doctor's shouting continues]
-Shit!

17:25.628 --> 17:28.422
[muffled screaming]

17:29.173 --> 17:32.301
[breathing heavily]

17:32.385 --> 17:34.512
Could you please take me
to downtown Yangpo?

17:38.683 --> 17:41.894
[Dokyung] Heeju, it's Dokyung.
I escaped from the hospital.

17:41.978 --> 17:43.771
Call me on this number.
STYLE
::cue()

17:49.360 --> 17:52.280
[slot machines chiming and clicking]

17:52.363 --> 17:55.950
[cell phone vibrating]

17:58.995 --> 18:00.371
DIRECTOR PARK
INCOMING CALL

18:00.454 --> 18:02.665
[Male Gambler] Come on. Come on!

18:02.748 --> 18:04.917
-Yeah.
-[Hocheol] I need you to run a plate.

18:05.001 --> 18:06.377
Blue-colored Santa Fe.

18:06.711 --> 18:09.255
Last few digits,
five, two, seven, nine.

18:09.338 --> 18:11.591
[Male Gambler] No. What?
Hey! Hey, waiter!

18:11.674 --> 18:12.800
[Jinman] Hey!

18:12.883 --> 18:14.010
[car engine revving]

18:16.262 --> 18:18.347
-Whose is it?
-[Hocheol] How the fuck would I know?

18:18.431 --> 18:20.558
That's why I'm telling you
to run the plates!

18:20.641 --> 18:23.185
If you can find the car, even better.

18:23.686 --> 18:25.187
Where's Cha Yujin now?

18:26.188 --> 18:28.941
I checked the whole area
but her Renegade wasn't there.

18:29.442 --> 18:30.776
[Jinman] Your car was, though.

18:34.030 --> 18:35.031
I lost her.

18:37.742 --> 18:38.743
Did you kill her?

18:39.410 --> 18:41.329
[Hocheol] Just find the fucking Santa Fe!

18:41.412 --> 18:42.830
Can you do it today?

18:43.581 --> 18:45.499
[Jinman] I thought you wanted me
to stay out of it.

18:45.916 --> 18:47.668
Why do you keep doing this to me?

18:48.919 --> 18:50.087
[Hocheol] This is the last time.

18:51.005 --> 18:53.174
The chairman,
he gets back tomorrow.

18:57.136 --> 18:59.847
Yeah, exactly.
I'm done helping you.

19:00.473 --> 19:03.017
If this thing goes wrong,
I'll be the one taking the fall.

19:03.100 --> 19:04.560
[Hocheol] I'll give you
100 more gold chips.

19:07.063 --> 19:08.272
[exhales sharply]

19:08.898 --> 19:10.566
The hell is this man talking about?

19:10.650 --> 19:12.818
For fuck's sake,
fucking bastard.

19:13.444 --> 19:14.862
What'd I just say?

19:15.446 --> 19:17.031
I'm not doin' it.

19:17.114 --> 19:20.785
[Jinman] I bet you didn't even know
Lee Dokyung escaped from the hospital,

19:20.868 --> 19:23.704
did you?
Detective Kang is about to call you.

19:25.706 --> 19:27.667
I think you're fucked now, Park.

19:28.626 --> 19:30.211
Think carefully, now.

19:31.879 --> 19:33.005
[phone beeps]

19:34.465 --> 19:35.758
[exhales]

19:38.552 --> 19:40.221
This fucking asshole.

19:41.514 --> 19:43.099
Fuck that detective.

19:43.182 --> 19:44.517
Bastard.

19:45.017 --> 19:46.769
[exhales]

19:47.937 --> 19:50.064
Is Kim Heeju the only one left now?

19:50.147 --> 19:51.649
[coin drops in slot machine]

19:51.732 --> 19:53.526
[machine chiming]

19:56.487 --> 19:59.490
[breathing heavily]

20:13.129 --> 20:16.132
[blood squelching]

20:16.215 --> 20:19.218
[banging]

20:20.136 --> 20:21.178
Dammit.

20:21.762 --> 20:24.765
[distant banging]

20:29.770 --> 20:30.855
[train whistle blows]

20:30.938 --> 20:33.941
[wheels clacking on rails]

20:48.372 --> 20:51.709
[cell phone vibrates]

20:51.792 --> 20:53.127
[gasps lightly]

20:53.794 --> 20:55.212
[vibrating continues]

20:58.215 --> 20:59.467
WOOGY
INCOMING CALL

21:01.844 --> 21:04.388
-Yes?
-[Woogy] Hey, you fucking traitor!

21:04.472 --> 21:06.557
You ran off to save your own skin, huh?

21:06.640 --> 21:08.142
Some partner you are.

21:08.225 --> 21:10.478
[Heeju] You said you were gonna kill
Park Hocheol.

21:10.561 --> 21:12.188
Yeah, no shit!

21:12.980 --> 21:15.149
[Woogy] If you had just stayed there
like I said instead of running away,

21:15.232 --> 21:16.525
I could have killed him.

21:16.609 --> 21:18.110
Did Park see your face?

21:18.194 --> 21:19.445
[Woogy] I don't fucking know.

21:19.904 --> 21:21.489
It was so dark in there, I don't know.
I don't think so.

21:21.572 --> 21:22.698
What-what about you?

21:23.365 --> 21:26.076
I'm not sure.
I think he might have seen me.

21:26.911 --> 21:28.579
Ah, dammit.

21:30.331 --> 21:32.249
Wait for me at the workshop, okay?

21:32.333 --> 21:34.835
I'll go to the office tomorrow
and see how things are going.

21:34.919 --> 21:36.879
-Then I'll meet up with you.
-[Heeju] No.

21:36.962 --> 21:38.964
I told you I never want to see you again.

21:39.048 --> 21:41.217
[Woogy] What the fuck
are you talking about, Heeju?

21:41.300 --> 21:42.802
Things have changed now.

21:42.885 --> 21:44.845
And my potatoes are still there in
the back of your car!

21:44.929 --> 21:46.055
I need those, you know.

21:49.433 --> 21:50.768
Ah, shit.

21:50.851 --> 21:52.228
[Woogy] Heeju, don't forget.

21:52.311 --> 21:53.312
I'm from Yes Money.

21:53.395 --> 21:55.105
I'll just leave it
for you at the workshop.

21:55.189 --> 21:56.482
Pick it up there.

21:56.565 --> 21:57.650
Okay.

21:58.317 --> 22:00.569
Oh, hey, hey, hey, hey, yeah, yeah.
Heeju, Heeju.
STYLE
::cue()

22:00.653 --> 22:02.446
Have you heard anything from Lee Dokyung?

22:03.155 --> 22:05.115
I haven't. Why?

22:05.199 --> 22:07.827
[Woogy] Well, apparently he escaped
from the fucking hospital.

22:07.910 --> 22:09.662
Yes Money's looking for him, too.

22:10.871 --> 22:12.039
Listen.

22:13.249 --> 22:15.584
You need to hide the gold bars
in a better spot.

22:16.627 --> 22:17.795
And you better not tell anyone.

22:17.878 --> 22:21.340
How the hell did Cha Yujin even find out
the gold was in the mine, let alone Park?

22:22.424 --> 22:24.552
[Woogy] Heeju, please.
Don't trust anyone.

22:24.635 --> 22:26.220
How many times do I have
to fucking tell you,

22:26.303 --> 22:27.388
don't trust anyone?

22:27.471 --> 22:29.056
Especially Lee Dokyung.
Got it?

22:29.932 --> 22:31.141
[phone chimes and clicks]

22:31.934 --> 22:33.185
[inhales]

22:37.231 --> 22:38.607
[grunts]

22:44.321 --> 22:47.116
HEEJU, THIS IS DOKYUNG. I ESCAPED
FROM THE HOSPITAL. CALL ME AT THIS NUMBER.

22:57.877 --> 23:00.880
[cell phone vibrates]

23:01.922 --> 23:02.923
Hello?

23:03.716 --> 23:06.135
-[Heeju] Dokyung?
-Heeju, you okay?

23:08.053 --> 23:11.056
Yeah, I'm okay.
I'm doing fine.

23:11.140 --> 23:12.474
How about you? You okay?

23:12.558 --> 23:14.518
[Dokyung] Yeah, I'm okay.

23:14.602 --> 23:16.020
I'm so glad.

23:16.103 --> 23:17.980
I was so worried about you, Heeju.
[car horn honks]

23:18.397 --> 23:20.274
[Heeju] How did you get out
of the hospital?

23:21.150 --> 23:22.610
[Dokyung] I ran away.

23:22.693 --> 23:25.362
Park found out where the casket was
and I couldn't get a hold of you.

23:26.363 --> 23:28.365
You got my message, right?

23:28.949 --> 23:30.242
And you moved all the gold bars?

23:31.869 --> 23:33.954
Actually, maybe we should talk in person.

23:34.038 --> 23:35.706
Where are you now?
I can come to you.

23:35.789 --> 23:37.041
[inhales]

23:37.124 --> 23:39.084
Uh, no, I'll come to you.

23:39.168 --> 23:40.377
Where are you right now?

23:41.086 --> 23:42.296
[Dokyung] I'm still in Yangpo.

23:44.715 --> 23:45.966
I'll meet you there.

23:46.550 --> 23:48.969
Get a hotel room and then just send me
a message.

23:50.262 --> 23:53.390
Right now it's a bit dangerous,
so I'll come by tonight.

23:56.435 --> 23:57.436
Okay.

23:59.688 --> 24:04.526
Uh, and hey,
where are the gold bars now?

24:08.864 --> 24:11.200
Let's meet first.
I'll tell you about it then.

24:12.201 --> 24:13.535
[Dokyung] Okay.

24:14.578 --> 24:15.579
[phone chimes and disconnects]

24:22.044 --> 24:23.796
[exhales]

24:24.505 --> 24:25.965
[Jinman] What is this?

24:31.303 --> 24:33.263
Ah, seriously?

24:33.931 --> 24:35.766
You looking to buy a car, sir?

24:36.600 --> 24:39.436
No, I'm here to talk to you, Heo Donggu.

24:39.520 --> 24:42.481
Why do you wanna talk to me?
I didn't do anything wrong.

24:42.564 --> 24:43.774
Yeah, yeah.

24:43.857 --> 24:45.442
Let's just go in the office, all right?

24:48.195 --> 24:50.489
Oh, great. Shit.

24:50.572 --> 24:52.157
RESIDENT REGISTRATION CARD
JU HARAN

24:53.242 --> 24:54.243
Ju Haran?

24:54.326 --> 24:55.452
[Jinman] Not Kim Heeju?

24:56.286 --> 24:57.496
Yeah.

24:57.579 --> 24:59.373
Why, did she cause some kind of accident?

25:00.082 --> 25:01.834
All I-all I did was sell her a car.

25:01.917 --> 25:04.837
Anything else, I don't-I don't-
I don't know anything about her.

25:07.089 --> 25:09.800
[Jinman] Well, it's just a little weird.
It was this woman, right?

25:12.553 --> 25:13.721
-Yeah.
-[Jinman] It was?

25:13.804 --> 25:16.015
-[Donggu] Yeah.
-Look. Different name.

25:16.098 --> 25:18.934
[Jinman] So it wasn't Cha Yujin.
It was Kim Heeju.

25:19.018 --> 25:22.062
Wait. So then are the police looking
for her,

25:22.146 --> 25:24.356
or is it the people from Geumseong?

25:24.440 --> 25:26.483
Was Park here? Park Hocheol?

25:27.026 --> 25:29.570
Park Hocheol?
That fucking asshole coming here?

25:29.653 --> 25:32.990
No way! I'd kill that fucker
if he shows his face here.

25:33.365 --> 25:34.366
Sure he wouldn't kill you?

25:34.450 --> 25:36.243
[Donggu] Hey, man, you haven't
seen me throw a punch, have you?

25:36.326 --> 25:39.621
I'd take him down. What,
y-you think I'm some kind of weakling?

25:39.705 --> 25:43.083
Punching doesn't really mean anything
when Park Hocheol pulls a knife on you.

25:43.459 --> 25:44.960
[Donggu] Hold on.

25:45.044 --> 25:48.088
If Park Hocheol is involved,
this is about Geumseong.

25:48.839 --> 25:51.675
Did this woman you're looking
for take something that belongs to them?

25:51.759 --> 25:53.594
Just call me if you see Park Hocheol.

25:53.677 --> 25:56.805
How many times do I have to say?
I told you he wouldn't dare.

25:57.389 --> 25:59.558
All right.
Look, I get it.

26:00.309 --> 26:02.895
You obviously don't like him at all.
Wanna kill him, right?

26:03.729 --> 26:06.065
Of course I do.
You see what that prick did to my ear?
STYLE
::cue()

26:07.816 --> 26:10.944
HAENGBOK PAWNSHOP

26:11.028 --> 26:14.031
[rustling]

26:15.657 --> 26:16.825
[grunts]
[gold bars clang]

26:17.326 --> 26:19.119
[cell phone vibrates]

26:31.131 --> 26:33.050
[Dokyung] Skyday, room 2014.

26:33.133 --> 26:35.010
You can reach me at this number
from now on.

26:53.946 --> 26:54.988
[elevator door dings]

27:01.912 --> 27:03.789
[Female Automated Voice] 23rd floor.

27:03.872 --> 27:05.290
Doors closing.

27:28.897 --> 27:30.774
[Sina] 100 ten-kilo gold bars?

27:30.858 --> 27:31.859
[Dokyung] Yes.

27:32.651 --> 27:33.652
[Sina] What's the source?

27:34.528 --> 27:35.529
[Dokyung] Cambodia.

27:36.196 --> 27:38.699
[Sina] Hold up.
Is this about the recent leak?

27:40.492 --> 27:41.493
Yeah.

27:43.620 --> 27:47.708
So, it is stolen goods.
That's bold.

27:48.333 --> 27:51.920
[Dokyung] Well, Interpol's lost the trace.

27:52.004 --> 27:55.299
No records left in any account.
It's clean.

27:55.841 --> 28:01.346
At the price from two years ago,
I'd say it's a win-win for both sides.

28:02.264 --> 28:04.224
[Sina] I would like
to see the real thing first.

28:05.851 --> 28:07.102
When are you coming over?

28:08.562 --> 28:09.897
I will let you know.

28:11.189 --> 28:12.190
[Sina] Okay.

28:13.358 --> 28:14.818
[exhales]

28:24.578 --> 28:29.625
WHERE ARE YOU?
ABOUT CAMBODIA...

28:29.708 --> 28:31.084
INCOMING VOICE CALL

28:31.919 --> 28:33.462
Heeju, where are you?

28:34.171 --> 28:36.381
[Dokyung] I just talked to the people who
are gonna buy our gold.

28:37.174 --> 28:39.343
We should be able to get a good price
for all the bars.

28:41.595 --> 28:43.347
Good job, Heeju.

28:43.430 --> 28:44.514
It's over.

28:45.265 --> 28:47.601
We can just start our new lives together.

28:47.684 --> 28:49.144
[inhales and exhales]

28:51.229 --> 28:52.731
You still there?

28:52.814 --> 28:54.274
[Dokyung] Heeju, did you hear me?

28:55.817 --> 28:57.861
-I'm here.
-[Dokyung] Okay.

28:58.612 --> 28:59.863
You heard what I said, right?

29:01.573 --> 29:02.574
[inhales]

29:03.617 --> 29:05.535
They murdered Cha Yujin.

29:06.870 --> 29:08.580
[Dokyung] Yeah, I know.

29:08.664 --> 29:10.999
That asshole Park called
and tried to blackmail me.

29:13.126 --> 29:14.252
[grunts]

29:16.129 --> 29:17.172
But it's okay.

29:17.965 --> 29:19.466
[Dokyung] We've got nothing
to worry about.

29:20.258 --> 29:24.262
I have other contacts at airport security
so moving the gold shouldn't be a problem.

29:24.346 --> 29:26.431
Our Cambodian buyers said they'd help,
too.

29:27.683 --> 29:29.601
Cha Yujin told me everything.

29:29.685 --> 29:31.853
About how you two used to be together.

29:31.937 --> 29:33.647
[Dokyung] It didn't mean anything, Heeju.

29:33.730 --> 29:35.941
I don't know what she told you,
but you're different.

29:36.024 --> 29:37.275
It's different with us.

29:37.359 --> 29:39.653
Sh-she's just-she's nothing to me.

29:39.736 --> 29:41.530
Someone close to you just died.

29:42.614 --> 29:45.325
And it's okay because someone else
can help with shipping?

29:47.411 --> 29:48.662
[exhales]

29:50.330 --> 29:51.623
I guess you were right.

29:53.208 --> 29:55.836
Cha Yujin really meant nothing
to you at all.

29:55.919 --> 29:57.671
[Dokyung] That's what I was trying
to tell you.

29:57.754 --> 29:59.214
No one else matters.

29:59.297 --> 30:00.424
[exhales]
STYLE
::cue()

30:01.299 --> 30:02.843
You're different from all of them.

30:07.514 --> 30:09.016
[inhales]

30:12.769 --> 30:14.521
I think I've gone too far.

30:15.981 --> 30:18.400
[Dokyung] Where are you now?
I can come find you.

30:19.443 --> 30:21.194
I don't think I can see you today.

30:21.987 --> 30:24.364
I'm sorry. I'll call you later.

30:26.158 --> 30:27.159
[phone beeps]

30:28.285 --> 30:29.286
Wait.

30:31.830 --> 30:34.833
[♪ dramatic music]

31:01.359 --> 31:04.738
GANGWON SAEBAEK HOSPITAL

31:22.631 --> 31:23.882
[Heeju exhales]

31:30.764 --> 31:31.890
[exhales]

31:34.935 --> 31:35.936
[Heeju sighs]

31:50.909 --> 31:52.410
[Sunok] What have you been doing?

31:55.622 --> 31:56.748
Auntie.

31:59.417 --> 32:01.920
Let me sleep here just tonight.

32:02.963 --> 32:05.006
[inhales and exhales]

32:06.925 --> 32:08.468
I'm so tired.

32:13.348 --> 32:15.433
[inhales deeply]

32:15.517 --> 32:16.810
[Sunok] That's what it is.

32:18.395 --> 32:20.230
You smell like a coal mine.

32:25.068 --> 32:27.195
That damp coal smell.

32:27.863 --> 32:29.072
[Sunok inhales]

32:29.156 --> 32:31.533
The one that miners have on their clothes.

32:45.172 --> 32:48.175
JEIL WORKSHOP

32:48.258 --> 32:51.261
[rain pattering]

33:01.104 --> 33:04.107
[♪ tense music]

33:11.239 --> 33:13.867
[door creaks]

33:24.628 --> 33:25.629
Hoonseok?

33:29.174 --> 33:30.175
You brought it.

33:33.094 --> 33:34.095
Yeah.

33:35.138 --> 33:37.432
[Woogy] And the rest of the gold bars.
[gun cocks]

33:39.392 --> 33:40.810
Where are they?

33:47.567 --> 33:49.861
[breathing heavily]

33:49.945 --> 33:51.071
[Woogy] Tell me.

33:51.947 --> 33:53.531
Where did you hide the gold bars?
STYLE
::cue()

33:55.325 --> 33:56.576
I'm gonna shoot.

33:58.328 --> 33:59.871
Three.

34:02.958 --> 34:04.542
[inhales sharply]

34:04.626 --> 34:05.919
[Woogy] Two.

34:06.795 --> 34:08.129
One.

34:10.632 --> 34:11.633
[gun clicks]

34:16.972 --> 34:18.139
Good.

34:18.223 --> 34:20.100
[Woogy] Good, you got it now.
No matter what happens,

34:20.183 --> 34:22.560
you never tell anybody where the bars are.

34:23.520 --> 34:25.939
Seriously, Heeju,
if I wanted to I could've just...

34:26.773 --> 34:29.067
...I mean, how the hell could you
even think of betraying me like that?

34:32.112 --> 34:33.154
[inhales]

34:33.947 --> 34:35.156
[exhales]

34:40.745 --> 34:41.871
[Woogy] Look.

34:42.622 --> 34:44.165
This potato's what saved your life.

34:45.125 --> 34:46.209
[exhales]

34:46.876 --> 34:48.878
So did you meet up with Lee Dokyung?

34:50.213 --> 34:51.298
I didn't.

34:53.049 --> 34:54.050
Why not?

34:55.468 --> 34:57.304
Because I can't trust anyone.

34:57.804 --> 34:59.306
Not anymore.

35:00.223 --> 35:01.349
Wait a sec.

35:02.892 --> 35:05.770
So you're not going with Lee Dokyung?
Did you end things?

35:07.689 --> 35:11.484
[Woogy] Yes! Good job, Heeju!
You finally got it!

35:12.193 --> 35:14.321
Hell, you can't trust a guy like him!

35:14.404 --> 35:17.198
Heh, I was trying to tell you that
this whole time, and I-

35:17.282 --> 35:18.283
wait a minute.

35:19.409 --> 35:21.995
The thing is,
you still have all the gold bars.

35:22.621 --> 35:24.331
[Woogy] Is Dokyung really
just gonna walk away?

35:24.956 --> 35:27.125
Ah, shit.
Do I need to kill him?

35:27.709 --> 35:29.836
Don't think that I trust you, either.

35:31.630 --> 35:32.631
Okay.

35:33.923 --> 35:34.924
Be that way.

35:35.425 --> 35:36.426
[Woogy] You just use me.

35:37.093 --> 35:38.345
Keep on using me.

35:39.346 --> 35:40.764
As much as you want.

35:41.348 --> 35:42.807
[Woogy] Happy to be of service.

35:43.475 --> 35:47.103
For every two ten-kilo bars,
I get one one-kilo bar.

35:47.187 --> 35:48.188
Just one.

35:48.772 --> 35:50.273
Not too much, right?
[chuckles]

35:50.940 --> 35:52.817
[Woogy] Oh, yeah. That reminds me.

35:53.193 --> 35:56.071
I did the math and it should take us
about six months to sell them all.

35:56.571 --> 35:57.572
Six.

35:58.365 --> 36:00.700
[inhales and exhales]

36:00.784 --> 36:02.243
Park knows about me now.

36:02.327 --> 36:04.746
That means soon your whole company will,
too.

36:04.829 --> 36:07.165
Not to mention the police on top of that.

36:08.708 --> 36:10.669
And you're telling me we have
to last six more months?

36:10.752 --> 36:12.879
No.
They don't know.

36:13.296 --> 36:15.048
[Woogy] Park? He doesn't know.

36:17.008 --> 36:19.177
Cha Yujin must have told Park about me.

36:19.719 --> 36:22.138
The gold bars, everything.
He must know.

36:24.933 --> 36:26.559
If Park had known it was you,

36:26.643 --> 36:28.478
he wouldn't have gone to the mine.

36:28.853 --> 36:30.563
He would have gone to the pawnshop.

36:32.565 --> 36:34.984
So now here's the real question.

36:35.068 --> 36:36.111
[grunts]

36:37.362 --> 36:40.240
Park was alone. Why?

36:40.740 --> 36:42.450
After he killed Cha Yujin,

36:42.534 --> 36:44.911
he went to the mine alone
without telling anyone.

36:44.994 --> 36:45.995
[Woogy] Why did he do that?

36:48.915 --> 36:50.083
Because that way...

36:51.835 --> 36:54.838
-...he could keep all the gold.
-Bingo.

36:55.463 --> 36:57.173
And he didn't want Chairman Ahn
to find out.

36:57.257 --> 36:58.299
Chairman Ahn?

36:59.843 --> 37:00.844
The real owner of the gold.

37:03.638 --> 37:06.057
Geumseong's chair,
Ahn Gyuseok.

37:07.142 --> 37:09.519
[Woogy] Chairman Ahn gets back
to Korea today.

37:11.229 --> 37:12.939
And that means Park is fucked.

37:14.107 --> 37:15.108
Welcome back, Chairman.

37:15.191 --> 37:16.526
[All] Welcome back, sir!

37:17.277 --> 37:20.488
[Gyuseok] These are our partners
from Cambodia. Our executives.

37:20.572 --> 37:22.031
-Introduce yourselves.
-Yes, sir.

37:22.115 --> 37:24.325
-Director Jo.
-Thank you for coming all this way.

37:24.409 --> 37:26.119
These guys here, take care of 'em.

37:26.202 --> 37:27.662
-Nice to meet you.
-Give them anything they want.

37:27.746 --> 37:29.581
-You understand? Only the best.
-Of course, sir.

37:29.664 --> 37:30.915
[Jo] This way, please.

37:33.626 --> 37:34.836
-Come here.
-Sir.

37:34.919 --> 37:35.962
What is this?

37:36.921 --> 37:38.006
Be more subtle.

37:39.132 --> 37:40.759
Apologies.
STYLE
::cue()

37:44.971 --> 37:47.974
[birds chirping]

37:52.812 --> 37:54.022
Hey, step on it.

37:54.522 --> 37:58.026
My stomach is starting to hurt
from all that greasy food I had to eat.

37:58.902 --> 38:00.028
[exhales]

38:04.324 --> 38:06.493
Do I really have to ask about it?

38:07.368 --> 38:08.661
Right, yes.

38:10.830 --> 38:13.583
-So, Lee Dokyung, he-
-Managed to escape from the hospital.

38:16.544 --> 38:18.004
You're kidding, right?

38:18.087 --> 38:20.131
Why did I have to hear that
from someone else?

38:20.215 --> 38:21.800
It seemed like you had a busy schedule,

38:21.883 --> 38:24.636
so I was planning to report it
to you when you got back.

38:24.719 --> 38:26.971
You do not make decisions for me.

38:27.055 --> 38:28.431
Yes, sir.

38:30.391 --> 38:31.476
So the casket.

38:32.018 --> 38:34.395
Is it waiting for us at the hotel?

38:35.688 --> 38:37.232
I'm sorry, sir.

38:38.441 --> 38:40.777
Enough with the apologizing
"I'm sorry" shit.

38:42.904 --> 38:45.031
You should know me better
than anyone else by now.

38:46.157 --> 38:48.660
Have I ever said anything about all
the bullshit,

38:48.743 --> 38:51.204
or the way you all stab each other in
the back?

38:51.746 --> 38:54.123
There's only one thing I can't forgive.

38:54.207 --> 38:57.293
And that's any damage to the company.
I will not let that happen.

38:59.295 --> 39:00.547
I take responsibility.

39:02.090 --> 39:03.424
I'll find the casket, sir.

39:06.052 --> 39:07.303
It's too late now.

39:13.434 --> 39:16.437
[♪ suspenseful music]

39:20.900 --> 39:24.362
H.S HOTEL &amp; RESORT CONSTRUCTION

39:24.445 --> 39:26.197
[groans]

39:29.450 --> 39:31.578
[groaning]

39:42.422 --> 39:45.633
[Gyuseok] Huh, you know, maybe we dug
a little too deep.

39:45.717 --> 39:46.843
[grunts]

39:46.926 --> 39:48.094
Hey, Park Hocheol.

39:50.263 --> 39:52.974
[Gyuseok] Look where you are.
Shit.

39:53.057 --> 39:54.434
Think carefully, now.

39:56.394 --> 39:58.730
How did you know what was in the casket?

39:59.272 --> 40:00.857
Kim Jinman, he...

40:01.816 --> 40:03.067
...he told me.

40:03.776 --> 40:05.028
Ah.

40:05.111 --> 40:07.655
So the police already found out about it.

40:08.823 --> 40:10.867
And you decided not to tell me.

40:11.451 --> 40:12.911
You didn't bring it up.

40:13.328 --> 40:14.329
So that meant-

40:14.412 --> 40:16.706
[coughing]

40:16.789 --> 40:18.541
[gagging]

40:18.625 --> 40:20.752
So that meant I couldn't-

40:20.835 --> 40:22.003
I couldn't tell you.

40:22.086 --> 40:23.963
[gagging]

40:24.047 --> 40:26.174
[Gyuseok] That's not the reason.

40:26.257 --> 40:29.427
Otherwise, you would have
just asked me about it.

40:31.262 --> 40:33.681
[Gyuseok] Were you planning to find it
and take it for yourself?

40:33.765 --> 40:35.224
[splattering]

40:35.308 --> 40:37.810
[Gyuseok] Or did you already do it,
and now you're lying?

40:38.144 --> 40:39.979
Did you plan this with Lee Dokyung?

40:41.147 --> 40:43.024
No. No, sir.

40:43.107 --> 40:44.317
[Gyuseok] Right.

40:44.400 --> 40:46.736
Because if you had,
you wouldn't still be in Geumseong.

40:47.320 --> 40:50.281
[grunting]

40:51.699 --> 40:53.826
You probably would have fled already.

40:55.495 --> 40:57.413
[Gyuseok] Stay out of the business
with the casket.

40:58.623 --> 41:01.626
Go back to Yes Money
and keep doing what you used to do.
STYLE
::cue()

41:03.169 --> 41:05.588
[Gyuseok] Say hi to the shareholders
at Gold Land.

41:05.672 --> 41:07.382
Get 'em to sign that contract.

41:08.883 --> 41:12.720
Yeah, the more I think about it,
it's all you're really cut out for.

41:12.804 --> 41:14.889
[Hocheol breathing erratically]

41:14.973 --> 41:16.182
Get him out.

41:18.059 --> 41:21.562
Fuck, I must be getting old now.
I'm getting a bit soft, huh?

41:24.774 --> 41:26.484
[Woojin] You know what?
[lighter clicks]

41:27.402 --> 41:29.612
You should have reported
this whole thing right away.

41:29.696 --> 41:32.156
Coulda avoided the Chairman's wrath.

41:33.908 --> 41:35.410
[inhales]

41:35.910 --> 41:37.912
You got pretty lucky in the end, though.

41:38.329 --> 41:40.206
[Woojin] I mean, he wanted
to cut your ear off.

41:40.289 --> 41:41.708
I barely talked him out of it.

41:42.750 --> 41:44.794
Mm, from now on,

41:44.877 --> 41:47.296
you should keep your head down
at Yes Money. Gimmie that.

41:48.006 --> 41:50.633
I'll take care of the gold bars, okay?
Here.

41:51.134 --> 41:52.301
Come on, Park.

41:53.344 --> 41:55.513
How did you know about the gold bars?

41:56.514 --> 41:58.558
I was in Yangpo then, wasn't I?

41:58.641 --> 42:00.184
[laughs]

42:00.268 --> 42:02.520
I sent the casket.
I've always known.

42:03.187 --> 42:06.691
[Woojin] You've lost your fucking touch,
you know know that?

42:06.774 --> 42:08.860
[Woojin inhales on cigarette]

42:08.943 --> 42:10.570
You don't know your place.

42:11.529 --> 42:13.031
Hey, here you go.

42:13.114 --> 42:14.365
[shovel clanging]

42:14.449 --> 42:15.742
Good luck getting out of there!

42:16.576 --> 42:18.077
[car doors closing]

42:18.161 --> 42:21.164
[engines revving]

42:37.680 --> 42:39.098
[grunts]

42:41.267 --> 42:44.270
[grunting]

42:44.353 --> 42:46.439
[breathing heavily]

43:06.292 --> 43:09.295
[blowtorch roaring]

43:09.378 --> 43:11.130
[Heeju] Park isn't the only one.

43:11.631 --> 43:13.508
I think someone else saw me, too.

43:13.591 --> 43:15.134
What do you mean?
Who saw you?

43:16.427 --> 43:17.428
Kim Jinman.

43:19.055 --> 43:21.599
I think he saw me getting
into my car that night.

43:22.850 --> 43:26.062
When I was running away from
the Jeongsan nightclub with Cha Yujin.

43:26.145 --> 43:27.814
Listen to me! Open the door!

43:27.897 --> 43:30.024
Look, look, look!
Roll, roll, roll down your window!

43:30.108 --> 43:32.443
He must not have seen you
'cause he would have reported you

43:32.527 --> 43:33.945
to my company right away.

43:34.987 --> 43:36.280
Yeah, but you know...

43:37.156 --> 43:40.201
...what if he's not saying anything
because he wants the gold for himself?

43:40.284 --> 43:42.203
Park never said anything, either.

43:42.286 --> 43:43.913
Ah, shit.

43:46.749 --> 43:47.750
Heeju.

43:48.417 --> 43:51.295
Your old phone and credit card.
You threw those away, right?

43:53.881 --> 43:55.508
Then you got no choice.

43:57.510 --> 43:59.637
You have to be Ju Haran
for the rest of your life.

44:00.304 --> 44:02.348
[exhales sharply]

44:02.431 --> 44:04.225
Don't worry about it.

44:05.268 --> 44:06.727
If Detective Kim finds out...

44:07.478 --> 44:09.188
...then I'll simply go
and kill him for you.

44:10.690 --> 44:12.358
[Woogy] Then you can give me
an extra potato.

44:14.402 --> 44:15.403
Deal?
STYLE
::cue()

44:19.365 --> 44:20.366
[Jinman] Hello.

44:20.449 --> 44:23.452
[distant sirens blaring]

44:28.875 --> 44:30.585
Hi, there. Hey.

44:31.252 --> 44:33.045
Uh, room five.

44:33.129 --> 44:35.089
Was Yeo Sunok discharged already?

44:35.173 --> 44:37.800
Uh, no. She was moved
to a private room.

44:38.426 --> 44:39.594
-She was?
-[Female Nurse] Yes.

44:41.846 --> 44:43.306
[Mija] Wow, so pretty!

44:44.056 --> 44:45.558
[Mija laughs]
[door slides open]

44:45.641 --> 44:47.226
Now, here.

44:47.310 --> 44:48.477
[Mija] Ah!

44:48.561 --> 44:51.355
Oh, wow.
What a nice room you got here.

44:51.439 --> 44:52.481
-Huh?
-[Mija] Sorry, who-

44:52.565 --> 44:54.734
-[Jinman] Must be pretty expensive.
-[Mija] Who are you?

44:55.067 --> 44:56.068
[Both] Oh.

44:56.152 --> 44:57.278
Is he from the ER?

44:57.778 --> 45:00.281
-Could you just give us a second?
-[Mija] Hmm?

45:01.991 --> 45:02.992
Oh.

45:06.120 --> 45:09.624
[Jinman] This really is a nice room.
Wow.

45:09.707 --> 45:10.875
[Jinman clears throat]

45:10.958 --> 45:13.544
[Jinman] When were you put in here?
Damn, look at this view.

45:14.253 --> 45:15.838
Isn't it too expensive, though?

45:16.339 --> 45:17.423
Why are you here?

45:17.506 --> 45:19.425
Just wanted to say hi
to an old friend.

45:19.508 --> 45:20.635
Can't a guy do that?

45:20.718 --> 45:23.638
Who knows?
We might not have much time left.

45:24.472 --> 45:26.557
I'm not just talkin' about you.

45:26.641 --> 45:30.228
I mean, at our age, who doesn't have some
kind of illness or some other kinda shit?

45:30.311 --> 45:32.021
I got diabetes.

45:32.104 --> 45:33.689
[Jinman] And my liver's not great, either.

45:33.773 --> 45:36.108
I could go any day now, you know?

45:36.192 --> 45:38.236
[inhales and exhales sharply]

45:39.487 --> 45:40.696
Hey.

45:40.780 --> 45:42.490
Isn't it weird we both live in Jeongsan

45:42.573 --> 45:44.659
but we've never run
into each other before now?

45:44.742 --> 45:46.786
[Sunok] More like we pretended not to.

45:47.536 --> 45:49.580
I saw you a couple times.

45:49.664 --> 45:50.831
Why didn't you say anything?

45:51.582 --> 45:52.833
[scoffs]

45:52.917 --> 45:54.377
What's the point in that?

45:55.294 --> 45:57.129
There's nothing left between us.

45:57.213 --> 45:58.214
[scoffs]

45:58.839 --> 45:59.840
[clears throat]

46:00.341 --> 46:01.342
And your husband?

46:02.134 --> 46:03.261
[Jinman] Has he come to see you?

46:04.387 --> 46:05.930
No, he hasn't.

46:06.889 --> 46:08.975
Well, still, doesn't seem like
he's that bad of a guy.

46:09.058 --> 46:10.393
I mean, he even dropped the charges..

46:11.936 --> 46:13.104
[inhales]

46:13.187 --> 46:15.564
If you're done saying hi,
you should just go.

46:16.274 --> 46:19.277
Instead of hanging around here,
dredging up old memories.

46:19.360 --> 46:21.445
Ah, come on, now.
Don't be like that.

46:23.447 --> 46:25.032
Oh, by the way.
Who is Ju Haran?

46:25.825 --> 46:28.536
I asked at the front desk
and the receptionist said Ju Haran

46:28.619 --> 46:30.705
is your guardian,
but I thought it'd be Han Cheoljung.

46:31.622 --> 46:32.623
I don't know.

46:32.707 --> 46:34.166
What do you mean?
It's your guardian.

46:34.250 --> 46:35.626
Don't tell me you don't know.

46:37.878 --> 46:39.088
Here, wait.

46:40.381 --> 46:41.382
Look at this.

46:42.258 --> 46:43.259
[Jinman] It's her.

46:43.926 --> 46:45.011
Yeah.

46:45.720 --> 46:46.721
Right?

46:47.763 --> 46:49.724
Must be. Yeah.

46:49.807 --> 46:52.601
I remember seeing her here the other day
when I came to visit you.

46:53.561 --> 46:54.854
[Jinman] It is her, right?

46:54.937 --> 46:56.272
[inhales]

46:56.355 --> 46:57.648
But then I thought,

46:57.732 --> 47:00.901
"This woman's name is Kim Heeju, right?"

47:01.527 --> 47:02.570
Who is she?

47:02.653 --> 47:03.696
Your daughter?

47:04.780 --> 47:05.781
No.

47:06.240 --> 47:07.491
My niece.

47:07.575 --> 47:08.617
Your niece?

47:09.368 --> 47:11.203
I didn't know that you had a niece.

47:11.746 --> 47:13.956
-I do.
-[Jinman] I see.

47:14.540 --> 47:18.002
Oh, so then your niece,
she must be pretty well-off, right?

47:18.961 --> 47:20.296
She got you into this fancy room

47:20.379 --> 47:21.672
and already took care
of your hospital bills.

47:23.132 --> 47:24.425
[Jinman] Where does she live?

47:24.508 --> 47:25.801
Jeongsan?

47:25.885 --> 47:27.303
When is she back?

47:28.262 --> 47:29.263
I don't know.

47:30.556 --> 47:32.975
She stopped by when she heard I was sick.

47:33.684 --> 47:34.769
Why do you ask?

47:35.811 --> 47:38.564
Why do you wanna know when she'll be here?

47:38.647 --> 47:41.108
Well, you told me she's your niece,
so I'd like to meet her.

47:41.942 --> 47:43.235
What? Why?

47:43.819 --> 47:45.488
Has she been gambling or something?

47:45.988 --> 47:47.198
Is she in trouble?

47:47.281 --> 47:48.282
No.

47:49.075 --> 47:50.284
[Sunok] Then...

47:50.951 --> 47:53.204
...did she murder someone
or anything like that?

47:53.621 --> 47:56.207
Come on.
What an awful thing to say.

47:56.290 --> 47:57.666
Nothing like that.

47:57.750 --> 47:59.627
[Jinman] No, she just borrowed some money.

48:00.628 --> 48:02.213
-How much was it?
-[Jinman] A lot.

48:02.296 --> 48:03.798
Actually...

48:04.590 --> 48:06.175
...it's not just about the money.

48:06.967 --> 48:09.637
Though I'd hate for someone her age
to end up with a criminal record.

48:10.096 --> 48:11.889
[Jinman] It's not too late for her
to pay it back.

48:11.972 --> 48:13.891
Or if that's not possible,

48:13.974 --> 48:16.227
then she could try and reach some kind
of settlement at least.

48:16.310 --> 48:19.271
Looks like she turned off her phone,
and disappeared instead.

48:20.398 --> 48:21.565
[Jinman] That's why I brought her up.

48:22.066 --> 48:24.318
So if she calls you or comes to visit,

48:24.402 --> 48:25.903
please be sure to let me know.

48:26.529 --> 48:28.531
I'll be more than happy
to help her settle the matter.

48:28.614 --> 48:29.740
[Jinman] All right?

48:30.282 --> 48:31.617
Don't tell her I was here, though.

48:31.700 --> 48:34.120
If she knows the police are involved,
she won't show up.

48:37.540 --> 48:41.168
There's nothing to worry about, hmm?
I won't do anything to your niece.

48:41.627 --> 48:44.338
-[Jinman] Call me, okay?
-[Female Nurse] Ms. Yeo Sunok?

48:44.422 --> 48:45.923
I need to check your temperature.

48:46.882 --> 48:47.883
[clears throat]
STYLE
::cue()

48:49.093 --> 48:50.094
Huh?

48:54.390 --> 48:57.101
All right.
I'll head out now.

48:57.184 --> 48:58.978
You'll give me a call, right?

48:59.937 --> 49:00.938
Yeah.

49:01.480 --> 49:02.648
[machine beeping]

49:02.731 --> 49:04.692
[Jinman] Take care of yourself.
Get some rest.

49:08.696 --> 49:10.990
[exhales]

49:11.073 --> 49:14.994
[JEIL WORKSHOP]

49:15.077 --> 49:18.080
[♪ dramatic music]

49:30.885 --> 49:31.886
[exhales]

49:33.095 --> 49:34.096
[light clicks on]

49:50.279 --> 49:51.614
[exhales sharply]

49:55.493 --> 49:56.494
[phone chimes]

49:56.577 --> 49:59.580
[phone trilling]

49:59.663 --> 50:00.664
[receiver clicks]

50:01.499 --> 50:03.125
[Dokyung] Hey, Heeju.
Where are you?

50:06.212 --> 50:07.755
-Uh, Dokyung-
-[Dokyung] Tell me where you are

50:07.838 --> 50:09.340
and I'll come find you
so we can talk.

50:17.473 --> 50:19.308
I'm not really sure that's a good idea.

50:19.391 --> 50:20.392
[sniffs]

50:21.894 --> 50:24.480
Do you think we can go back
to how things used to be?

50:25.481 --> 50:26.607
[Dokyung] What do you mean?

50:27.858 --> 50:30.027
Is it-is this because
of the whole Cha Yujin thing

50:30.110 --> 50:31.570
because I never told you about her?

50:33.113 --> 50:34.114
[exhales]

50:36.158 --> 50:37.785
You're right.

50:37.868 --> 50:40.246
I took advantage of a woman I was dating,
but Heeju...

50:41.121 --> 50:42.498
...it's different with us.

50:44.083 --> 50:45.251
[Heeju] I think that...

50:46.252 --> 50:49.004
...I was actually
the one taking advantage of you.

50:49.797 --> 50:50.798
When we first met...

50:51.757 --> 50:53.759
...I saw you as my only way out.

50:55.010 --> 50:58.097
No, Heeju, it's okay.
We can be happy like before.

50:58.180 --> 51:00.849
That money will fix everything.
What more could we need?

51:04.395 --> 51:05.646
Yangpo is out.

51:06.230 --> 51:08.274
They've tightened up security.
It's too risky.

51:09.650 --> 51:12.319
So I was thinking
a boat might be our best bet.

51:13.529 --> 51:14.655
[Dokyung] We stowaway?

51:15.281 --> 51:16.282
Mm-hmm.

51:17.241 --> 51:20.494
[Heeju] I know someone who uses
cargo ships to export cars.

51:22.162 --> 51:23.539
How do you know them?

51:25.583 --> 51:27.418
Turns out money can do anything.

51:27.918 --> 51:30.588
[Dokyung] Okay, then.
Let's move as quickly as possible.

51:31.088 --> 51:33.215
[Heeju] No, I'm not going with you.

51:33.757 --> 51:35.009
You're going by yourself.

51:35.593 --> 51:37.386
And the gold bars...

51:39.221 --> 51:40.431
...we should split them.

51:41.015 --> 51:42.016
[Dokyung] What?

51:42.683 --> 51:43.684
I...

51:44.602 --> 51:47.062
I think I deserve at least that much.
Don't you?

51:47.146 --> 51:50.357
I risked my life to keep them hidden.
So here's what we'll do.

51:50.983 --> 51:55.029
On the day you head for Cambodia,
I'll bring your share by car.

51:55.112 --> 51:56.822
[Heeju] I'll bring your passport, too.

51:56.905 --> 51:58.782
So you can just meet me at the port.

52:00.618 --> 52:02.870
And you won't try and find the rest
of the gold bars.

52:02.953 --> 52:05.080
[Dokyung] What? Heeju.
What are you talking about?

52:05.164 --> 52:07.207
Look, tell me where you are.

52:07.291 --> 52:08.667
Can we please just talk about this
in person?

52:09.418 --> 52:10.502
Whatever you say.

52:11.045 --> 52:13.297
We can just split the gold bars,
if that's what you want.

52:13.380 --> 52:15.049
But can we at least talk in person?

52:15.591 --> 52:16.717
[Dokyung] Where are you now?

52:16.800 --> 52:18.260
Are you still staying at the pawnshop?

52:18.344 --> 52:20.262
No, I'm not there anymore.

52:20.888 --> 52:22.014
Don't go there.

52:22.598 --> 52:24.558
And don't come looking for me, either.

52:25.184 --> 52:26.185
[phone chimes]

52:27.102 --> 52:28.771
Wait, Hee-Heeju.
[phone chimes and disconnects]

52:31.649 --> 52:34.401
[cell phone vibrating]

52:34.485 --> 52:35.486
[exhales sharply]

52:35.569 --> 52:37.988
INCOMING CALL

52:44.453 --> 52:45.913
POWER OFF

52:45.996 --> 52:46.997
[Heeju exhales]
[phone chimes]

52:52.753 --> 52:54.088
[sighs]

52:59.093 --> 53:00.219
[phone chimes]

53:00.302 --> 53:03.055
[Female Operator] Your call has been
forwarded to an automated voice-

53:03.138 --> 53:05.224
[phone chiming]

53:05.933 --> 53:08.268
Fuck! Why are you doing this?

53:08.352 --> 53:10.979
[breathing heavily]

53:11.063 --> 53:12.356
[groans]

53:12.940 --> 53:14.400
[exhales]
STYLE
::cue()

53:19.613 --> 53:22.616
[car approaching]

53:26.161 --> 53:27.663
[Hoonseok] Boss.

53:27.746 --> 53:29.206
I want to repay you for everything.

53:29.998 --> 53:33.752
I know this isn't anything special,
but I made it for you.

53:34.253 --> 53:35.254
Here.

53:37.172 --> 53:39.508
It's a four-leaf clover.
It brings good luck.

53:41.135 --> 53:44.680
So if you wear it then you'll be lucky.

53:46.849 --> 53:49.476
Oh, I made it with my own share
of the potatoes,

53:49.560 --> 53:51.520
so you don't have to worry about that.

53:53.230 --> 53:54.398
Is that true?

53:54.481 --> 53:55.482
What?

53:56.442 --> 53:57.693
[Heeju] If I keep this with me...

53:59.653 --> 54:02.114
...will it really bring good luck,
even to me?

54:02.698 --> 54:05.325
Um, well, no.

54:05.909 --> 54:08.412
It's just a superstition, of course.

54:08.495 --> 54:13.625
But believing in things like that
can still bring us comfort.

54:17.838 --> 54:18.839
[exhales]

54:24.511 --> 54:25.512
Thank you.

54:26.513 --> 54:29.475
Take care of yourself, Heeju.

54:41.612 --> 54:43.655
[Woogy] All right.
So what'd he say?

54:43.739 --> 54:46.617
[car engine rumbling]

54:46.700 --> 54:49.661
[engine revving]

54:56.460 --> 54:57.628
[Woogy] By the way.

54:59.171 --> 55:02.174
Heeju, do you have to go this far?

55:02.257 --> 55:03.717
Just for Lee Dokyung?

55:04.801 --> 55:06.678
I mean, you're helping with his travel.

55:08.388 --> 55:10.182
And giving him half
of the gold bars, too.

55:13.685 --> 55:16.438
I just, I overheard you talking on
the phone yesterday.

55:17.397 --> 55:19.107
It's not like I meant to.

55:19.358 --> 55:21.235
It was an accident!
It was.

55:21.318 --> 55:23.820
I went back to grab something I left
and I heard you.

55:23.904 --> 55:25.989
It really, really was an accident.

55:30.536 --> 55:32.079
It was his to begin with.

55:32.788 --> 55:35.249
I figured I should give him his share.

55:35.332 --> 55:37.543
Lee Dokyung's share
is half of the bars?

55:37.626 --> 55:38.961
[Woogy scoffs]
Really?

55:39.545 --> 55:40.921
Heeju, do you-

55:41.004 --> 55:42.548
do you still love that asshole?

55:43.090 --> 55:45.634
Huh? Even after everything he did to you?

55:45.717 --> 55:47.219
Didn't you break up already?

55:48.387 --> 55:49.513
Yeah, we did.

55:53.058 --> 55:54.268
We're breaking up.

55:55.435 --> 55:58.021
But it's not like I want him
to be unhappy.

55:58.105 --> 55:59.690
What does that even mean?

56:00.941 --> 56:02.859
Ugh, I don't know.
Leave me alone.

56:02.943 --> 56:04.111
It's my gold anyway.

56:04.194 --> 56:05.404
No, it's mine, too!

56:06.446 --> 56:09.116
Of those 100 gold bars,
5% belongs to me.

56:10.492 --> 56:12.286
You're just gonna give half to Dokyung?

56:12.369 --> 56:13.370
Okay, then.

56:13.829 --> 56:15.664
You can have 10% of my share.

56:16.248 --> 56:19.751
For every ten-kilo gold bar I cash in,
you get a one-kilo bar.

56:20.043 --> 56:21.044
Sound good?

56:24.339 --> 56:25.340
[inhales sharply]

56:25.424 --> 56:27.384
Wait a minute.
Let me just do the math.

56:28.010 --> 56:29.636
Four, five, six, seven.

56:30.679 --> 56:32.556
[gasps]
Ten billion?

56:34.558 --> 56:35.642
I get ten billion?

56:39.688 --> 56:43.525
Wow! Ten bill! Fuck me!

56:44.067 --> 56:45.777
[Heeju] Is that enough for you?

56:46.278 --> 56:47.738
That's all you've ever wanted?
STYLE
::cue()

56:49.156 --> 56:50.991
Why?

56:52.784 --> 56:54.161
[Woogy] Will you give me more if I ask?

56:56.496 --> 56:58.081
No, I was just wondering.

56:58.665 --> 57:00.292
You'd do anything for money.

57:00.751 --> 57:02.502
Yet you've been the least greedy.

57:04.046 --> 57:08.050
Every other person around me has tried
to steal everything I had.

57:09.384 --> 57:11.803
Really? Huh.
I, uh, never thought about it.

57:16.391 --> 57:19.394
[motorcycle engine rumbling]

57:21.229 --> 57:22.606
[brakes squeaking]

57:32.491 --> 57:34.618
[Delivery Man] Hi, good evening.
Did you order express delivery?

57:34.701 --> 57:35.702
Yeah.

57:35.786 --> 57:36.828
[Delivery Man] Okay.

57:40.582 --> 57:43.585
[♪ tense music]

58:00.060 --> 58:02.062
[car engine revving]

58:08.860 --> 58:11.321
HAENGBOK PAWNSHOP

58:11.405 --> 58:14.408
[phone ringing]

58:25.335 --> 58:26.920
[phone trilling]

58:27.003 --> 58:28.004
[phone chimes]

58:44.563 --> 58:47.566
[gate rattling]

58:52.320 --> 58:55.198
[door clanging]

58:55.282 --> 58:56.283
Fuck.

59:05.542 --> 59:08.545
[creaking]

59:15.844 --> 59:16.845
[snaps]

59:16.928 --> 59:19.931
[door creaking]

59:22.893 --> 59:24.394
[creaking]

59:25.228 --> 59:26.229
[lock clicks]

59:46.541 --> 59:49.544
[metal detector clicking]

59:52.881 --> 59:55.884
[metal detector beeping]

01:00:04.518 --> 01:00:05.519
[light clicks on]

01:00:06.478 --> 01:00:07.479
Why are you here?

01:00:08.647 --> 01:00:09.689
H-Heeju.

01:00:10.357 --> 01:00:11.399
[gun cocks]

